<title>GERMANY: Sixt 96 ord. act profit above 30 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>Sixt 96 ord. act profit above 30 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car rental group Sixt AG said on Wednesday that its 1996 profit from ordinary activities would be above 30 million marks.</p>
<p>Sixt earlier said it made 24 million marks in income from ordinary activities for the nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
